      {
        "key": "packaging_rules",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Total number of units = 9",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 1,
            "indent": 2,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-1",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "4 core units plus",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 2,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-2",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "5 elective units of which:",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 3,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-3",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "at least three (3) must be chosen from Group A",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 4,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-4",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-3"
          },
          {
            "text": "no more than two (2) may be chosen from Group B",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 5,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-5",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-3"
          },
          {
            "text": "no more than one (1) unit may be chosen from elsewhere within this training package, or from another endorsed training package, or from an accredited course.",
            "type": "bullet",
            "order": 6,
            "indent": 0,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-6",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": "packaging_rules-3"
          },
          {
            "text": "Elective units must be relevant to the work environment and the qualification, maintain the overall integrity of the AQF alignment and contribute to a valid vocational outcome.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 7,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-7",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The elective bank contains both licensed and non-licensed units of competency relating to high risk work in the resources and infrastructure industry. To be appointed under any statutory requirements in related roles, units of competency should be selected to meet the state/territory licensing requirements.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 8,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-8",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          },
          {
            "text": "There is one prerequisite in the imported units listed in this qualification. Where a unit is imported as an elective care must be taken to ensure that all prerequisites specified are complied with.",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "order": 9,
            "indent": null,
            "item_id": "packaging_rules-9",
            "parent_bullet_item_id": null
          }
        ],
        "order": 3,
